medium tracking-tight text-tss-ink">Durable Coatings and Elastomers</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-tss-ink/70">Imparts good weathering and hydrolysis resistance to polymers, making it ideal for exterior coatings, sealants, and elastomers that require long-term stability.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-tss-ink">Materials Science Research</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-tss-ink/70">Utilised in research and development for creating novel polymeric materials with tailored properties, leveraging its predictable reactivity and performance characteristics.</p></div></div></section><section class="mt-16 border-t border-tss-line pt-12"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-tss-gray"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-[0.6em] leading-none text-tss-ink">▶</span><span class="text-tss-ink">02 /</span>Properties</span><div class="mt-6"><table class="w-full max-w-3xl border-collapse text-left"><tbody><tr class="border-t border-tss-line align-top"><th scope="row" class="w-1/2 py-3 pr-6 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-tss-gray">Linear formula</th><td class="py-3 text-[15px] text-tss-ink [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">HO[CH2(CH2)4CH2OCO2]n CH2(CH2)4CH2OH</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-tss-line align-top"><th scope="row" class="w-1/2 py-3 pr-6 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-tss-gray">Boiling point</th><td class="py-3 text-[15px] text-tss-ink [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">332 °C</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-tss-line align-top"><th scope="row" class="w-1/2 py-3 pr-6 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-tss-gray">Density</th><td class="py-3 text-[15px] text-tss-ink [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">1.09 g/mL at 25 °C(lit.)</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-tss-line align-top"><th scope="row" class="w-1/2 py-3 pr-6 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium upperca